Subject: Keep Linux libplacebo private to libmpv

Debian FFmpeg can depend on an older libplacebo SONAME with the same unversioned
symbols. Link the new libplacebo statically and hide its symbols, preventing ABI
interposition without rebuilding or replacing the distribution's FFmpeg libraries.
Windows continues to use its matching MSYS2 shared dependency.

--- a/meson.build
+++ b/meson.build
@@ -30,3 +30,7 @@
 libplacebo = dependency('libplacebo', version: '>=7.387.0',
+                static: host_machine.system() == 'linux',
                 default_options: ['default_library=static', 'demos=false'])
+if host_machine.system() == 'linux'
+    add_project_link_arguments('-Wl,--exclude-libs,libplacebo.a', language: 'c')
+endif
 
